// About
section#about.section.section-xl.bg-default
    .container
        .row.row-30.row-lg-50
            .col-xl-12( data-animate!={class: 'fadeInUp'} )
                .h5.sup.text-primary About our Event
                h2 Namaste!

            .col-xl-9.offset-xl-1(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInLeft'} )
                p.lead.pr-xl-5 Our International Festival has been conceived and held since 2007 as an interesting and lively meeting prepared by yogis and for yogis. In 2021, the 10th anniversary Lintense Awake Yoga Festival. The authors of the idea for the festival are yoga teachers Cameron Williamson and Bessie Cooper. Classes with us are conducted only by high-level professionals, and attending master classes will be most useful and fruitful for you.

            .col-12.text-center.offset-sm
                .row.row-30.row-lg-70
                    .col-12
                        h5.text-primary.decor Benefits Of Yoga & Mindfullness
                    .col-md-6.col-lg-3
                        .box-benefit(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInLeft'} )
                            .box-benefit-icon
                                +img('icon-01-100x100.svg')
                            .box-benefit-title
                                h5 Improves flexibility
                            .box-benefit-text
                                p Yoga poses work by stretching your muscles. They can help you move better.
                    .col-md-6.col-lg-3
                        .box-benefit(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInLeft'} )
                            .box-benefit-icon
                                +img('icon-02-100x100.svg')
                            .box-benefit-title
                                h5 Increases Strength
                            .box-benefit-text
                                p Yoga is also a great addition to an exercise routine for its strength-building benefits.
                    .col-md-6.col-lg-3
                        .box-benefit(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInRight'} )
                            .box-benefit-icon
                                +img('icon-03-100x100.svg')
                            .box-benefit-title
                                h5 Stress Relief
                            .box-benefit-text
                                p It is known that yoga significantly reduces stress and promotes relaxation.
                    .col-md-6.col-lg-3
                        .box-benefit(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInRight'} )
                            .box-benefit-icon
                                +img('icon-04-100x100.svg')
                            .box-benefit-title
                                h5 Good for Your Heart
                            .box-benefit-text
                                p Yoga has long been known to lower blood pressure and slow the heart rate.
